---
import {languageContributionURL} from '../lib/language-contribution.mjs';
const {language=''}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="language-invitation" id="share-a-voice" aria-labelledby="voice-invitation-title">
 <div><p class="eyebrow">The next chapter can begin with you</p><h2 id="voice-invitation-title">A word remembered.<br/><em>A story worth keeping.</em></h2></div>
 <div><p>Speak {language||'a language of Odisha'}? Recommend a book, improve an explanation or propose a story you have permission to share. Tell us whose voice it is and where it belongs.</p><p><a class="text-link" href={languageContributionURL(language)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prepare a {language ? language+' ' : ''}proposal on GitHub ↗</a></p><p class="language-public-note">A GitHub account is needed. You review the draft before posting; submitted issues are public. Keep private details and consent documents out of the issue. Recordings need permission and a transcript before publication.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contribute/#language-contributions">How language contributions work →</a></div>
</section>
<style>
.language-invitation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,64px);background:var(--paper);border-top:3px solid var(--earth);padding:clamp(24px,4vw,48px);margin-block:48px}.language-invitation p{max-width:60ch;line-height:1.8}.language-invitation .language-public-note{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.language-invitation a{display:inline-block;padding-block:10px}.language-invitation h2{margin-top:12px}@media(max-width:800px){.language-invitation{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
